WEBVTT

00:04:58.672 --> 00:05:01.664
They are in this constant state of wonder,

00:05:01.664 --> 00:05:05.354
and I do firmly believe that we can keep listening

00:05:05.354 --> 00:05:07.638
like these seven-year-old children,

00:05:07.638 --> 00:05:10.112
even when growing up.

00:05:10.112 --> 00:05:12.261
And that is why I have played

00:05:12.261 --> 00:05:14.601
not only in the concert hall

00:05:14.601 --> 00:05:18.930
but also on the street, online, in the air:

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:21.497
to feel that state of wonder,

00:05:21.497 --> 00:05:23.679
to truly listen,

00:05:23.679 --> 00:05:27.223
and to listen without prejudice.

00:05:27.223 --> 00:05:29.349
And I would like to invite you

00:05:29.349 --> 00:05:32.382
to do so now.